========================================================================
ACCEPTANCE TEST: article section-1 counterexample
  'an evidence receipt can correctly describe a WRITE effect
   when the valid delegation path permits only READ'
========================================================================

COUNTEREXAMPLE  effect=ledger.write  resource=invoice-999
  policy required_effect             : ledger.read
  terminal granted tools             : ["ledger.read"]
  terminal granted resources         : ["invoice-123"]
  shipped evidence evaluator says    : PASS
  layer results                      : {"authority": "ALLOW", "evidence": "PASS", "measurement": "PASS", "policy": "PASS", "state": "PASS"}
  failed layers                      : []
  binding result                     : EFFECT_MISMATCH
  VERDICT                            : DENY
  first rejecting gate               : binding.effect

LOOKALIKE       effect=ledger.read   resource=invoice-123
  layer results                      : {"authority": "ALLOW", "evidence": "PASS", "measurement": "PASS", "policy": "PASS", "state": "PASS"}
  binding result                     : PASS
  VERDICT                            : ALLOW
  first rejecting gate               : verified

CHECKS
  ok   shipped evidence evaluator still passes the WRITE receipt
  ok   all five artefact verifiers pass on the counterexample
  ok   counterexample binding result is EFFECT_MISMATCH
  ok   counterexample composed verdict is DENY
  ok   counterexample first rejecting gate is binding.effect
  ok   lookalike binding result is PASS
  ok   lookalike composed verdict is ALLOW
  ok   lookalike first rejecting gate is verified
  ok   the two transactions differ ONLY in the observed subject
  ok   determinism: recomposing the counterexample is identical

========================================================================
ACCEPTANCE TEST PASSED: the counterexample the article names is denied at the binding gate with every component verifier passing, and its matched lookalike is allowed.
========================================================================
